  "root_review": "Read all three complete target Latin, old English and selected historical English, exact receiving dictionaries, independent fidelity and printing findings. Personally inspected six full images: title, approvals, accession leaf and continuous ordinary folios1737–1739. Rehashed all8 supplied images, nine new source outputs and graph receipt; verified actual current three old English dictionaries and exact reviewer/source joins.",
  "whole_expression_judgment": "Accept as explicitly qualified historical renderings: Second Collect preserves souls/servants/handmaids, refreshment/rest/blessedness/light without unsupported anniversary; Second Postcommunion retains pardon/rest despite singular sacrifice and implicit pariter; Third Collect preserves full departed beneficiary group and intercession without narrowing to brethren, although souls is implicit and desirest/partake are interpretive. These are disclosed source translations, not literal glosses or approved1962English.",
  "printing_and_publication_judgment": "Apply the existing registered United States pre1931 textual public-domain basis only to these exact three settings.1924/1925 approvals and actual1927 accession, continuous regular folios1737–1739, shared typography and own-prayer override headings jointly support the early-expression inference with moderate confidence. Approval dates alone are insufficient; possible later replacement/rebinding is the strongest contrary, not excluded with certainty. No exact1925 colophon or whole-composite authentication is asserted.",
